b84ab8afddcb"],

Cell["\<\
The toolkit is currently implemented as a Script rather than as a package for \
development speed and for transparency. That means that all symbols will be \
loaded into the Global namespace, including internal variables in Module \
constructs. This minor inconvenience will be mitigated in a future version.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978188523075684*^9, 3.978188555596314*^9}, {
  3.978189800818763*^9, 
