0ddaf72add34"],

Cell["\<\
As with \[CapitalGamma], we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll index Riemann via coordinate \
symbols. Look at a couple of components and check a famous antisymmetry \
condition:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978195814353423*^9, 3.978195893642148*^9}, 
   3.9782164619888687`*^9, {3.978216526474206*^9, 3.978216527130972*^9}, {
